15% of 240 is **36**.

To calculate this: 15% = 15/100 = 0.15, so 0.15 × 240 = 36.

Or you can think of it as: 240 × 15 = 240 × 15/100 = 3600/100 = 36.

Or as a fraction: 15% = 3/20 (since 15% = 15/100 = 3/20, simplifying by 5), so (3/20) × 240 = 720/20 = 36.

